	IntroBodyFmt = "You stole corporate tech. The corporation wants it back.\n\n"\
	               "<fame>Goal</fame>   Sell the tech to the <good>Buyer</good> in sector {0}. Each jump to a new system is one sector.\n"\
	               "<fame>Heat</fame>   Rises over time and with each mission. It has {1} stages, and each stage sends hunters.\n"\
	               "<fame>Cool</fame>   A jump to a new system drops heat to {2:0%}.\n"\
	               "<fame>Cargo</fame>  The tech sits in your Tech Vaults. Damage destroys it. If all of it is gone, the run ends.\n"\
	               "<fame>Sell?</fame>  You can sell tech at stations on the way: less heat, more money, a lower final score."
